Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,78)}合宿的事情我和奶奶说了\N她同意了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,158)}是吗 那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,203)}但是一开始她骂我不要脸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,248)}诶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,293)}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,338)}我忘了说是学习合宿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,383)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,428)}这还挺重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,473)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,518)}不过我已经解释清楚了\N没问题了！你那边怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,598)}我没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,643)}好久没去龙二家了\N以前经常去的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,723)}好期待去师傅家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\fs32\pos(50,768)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,813)}前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\fs32\pos(445,858)}谢谢{\fscx50} {\fscx}!
