Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.02,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\pos(50,115)\fs32}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.02,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\pos(425,160)\fs32}嗯 注意保暖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.02,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\pos(425,205)\fs32}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.02,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\pos(50,250)\fs32}感冒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.02,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\pos(50,295)\fs32}请假
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.02,E,,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H5DBE4A&\bord0\pos(425,340)\fs32}你还好吗？\N注意身体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.02,E,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H414141&\bord0\pos(50,420)\fs32}谢谢
